        "internal/httpapi/productivity.go:627 — ORDER BY (draft_key=$3) DESC, updated_at DESC LIMIT $2: boolean true sorts first in PostgreSQL, so the just-upserted key is always inside the LIMIT window and the row count still cannot exceed maxFormDraftsPerUser. draft_key is NOT NULL (006_productivity.sql), so NOT IN has no NULL pitfall.",
